@base = http://localhost:8000
@token = REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN
@reportId = REPLACE_WITH_REPORT_UUID

### Health
GET {{base}}/health/ready

### All twelve category IDs and disposal guidance
GET {{base}}/api/v1/categories

### Register (example values, no account is preconfigured)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"pengguna@example.com","password":"ReplaceThis1!","full_name":"Pengguna WasteWise"}

### Login
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"pengguna@example.com","password":"ReplaceThis1!"}

### Current account
GET {{base}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter reports, all predicates applied by server
GET {{base}}/api/v1/reports?page=1&per_page=10&category=plastic&status=Pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Prediction with an actual local JPEG sample
POST {{base}}/api/v1/predict
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WasteWiseBoundary

--WasteWiseBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="plastic.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ../web/public/materials/plastic.jpg
--WasteWiseBoundary--

### Report detail (a new signed URL is issued)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/reports/{{reportId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Administrator status update
PATCH {{base}}/api/v1/reports/{{reportId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"Completed"}

### Statistics scoped to current user (all reports for an administrator)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/stats/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete report and enqueue private-image deletion
DELETE {{base}}/api/v1/reports/{{reportId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
